>> title: Oatmeal Raisin Cookies
>> category: Cookies
>> tags: oats, raisins, cinnamon, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery, Deli
>> aka: oatmeal cookies, oatmeal raisin
>> servings: 40
>> time: 35 min

Heat the #oven{} to 350°F (175°C) and line two #baking sheets{} with parchment.

>> step: cream
Cream @unsalted butter{1%cup}(226 g; softened) with @light brown sugar{1%cup}(220 g) and @granulated sugar{1/2%cup}(100 g).

>> step: beat in
Beat @eggs{2%large}(100 g) and @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL) into @&(~1)creamed butter{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1 1/2%cup}(190 g), @baking soda{1%tsp}(6 g), @ground cinnamon{1%tsp}(2.6 g), and @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Stir @&(~1)dry ingredients{} into @&(~2)batter{}.

>> step: stir in
Stir @rolled oats{3%cup}(270 g) and @raisins{1%cup}(150 g) into @&(~1)dough{}.

Bake @&(~1)dough{} in rounded spoonfuls at 350°F for ~{12%min}.
